t-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ibfce715369af4d5291e99f6ccc18d1ff_I20220930" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="3" id="_fd69ffcf-618f-45cb-8b7f-e6eb9e116798">225</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On May 17, 2022, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i04920cd6e57248e3aeb5c9e2e63831f5_D20220517-20220517" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM18yMTE3_00ace42e-5b2b-40ab-a889-02f10b070224">3,700,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock pursuant to a securities purchase agreement at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ia043e44b43a340df8c0b094dbb59793d_I20220517" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM18yMjEw_88b26085-188f-49bb-bb42-4eeef46e7e40">1.0632</ix:nonFraction> per share in a registered direct offering (Note 7). In connection with the registered direct offering, the Company issued warrants to purchase an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ia043e44b43a340df8c0b094dbb59793d_I20220517" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM18yMzcy_c4b59edc-afc6-418b-b600-4c2e42943883">3,700,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ia043e44b43a340df8c0b094dbb59793d_I20220517" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM18yNDIy_f4cd58f0-cf9b-452f-9d1c-5a01f79e9437">0.9382</ix:nonFraction> per share. The warrants were classified as a liability in accordance with ASC 815-40 and the fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="if4fc30e49cbd4ed482f24edf08a68b58_I20220930" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationsRecurringBasisLiabilityValue" scale="3" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM18yNTMy_06c8d3ba-a769-4dbc-8a0b-6c44ed1783fe">225</ix:nonFraction> is reflected in warrant liability on the accompanying Balance Sheets. The warrant liability was measured at fair value at inception and is revalued at each financial statement date, with changes in fair value presented within change in fair value of warrant liability in the accompanying Statements of Operations and Comprehensive Loss.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On July 25, 2022, the Company amended the terms of the warrants issued in May 2022 to obligate each warrant holder who signed the warrant amendment (Applicable Holder) to effect a cashless exercise, in whole, by August 10, 2022 (the Expiration Date). The warrant amendment entitled the Applicable Holder to receive one share of common stock for each warrant in lieu of the aggregate number of shares of common stock that would have been received using the cashless exercise formula set forth in the warrant agreement (Alternate Cashless Exercise). If the warrants held by the Applicable Holders were not exercised by the Expiration Date, they were automatically exercised pursuant to the Alternate Cashless Exercise. A total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="iabd02b09fb834ff2b09614dd7dbcd404_I20220725" decimals="INF" name="val:NumberOfWarrantsExercisedToAlternateCashlessExercise" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM18zNjAx_db8e9e4c-2990-4de6-b02f-611c879e8cb9">2,220,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants were exercised pursuant to the Alternate Cashless Exercise. As a result of the warrant conversion, the Company recognized a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i1fa0de33ec5d4864a080dffc5b0f0b2f_D20220101-20220930" decimals="-3" name="val:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityConvers