lspan="2" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i936187c463f94c91b1cbc8846b80f1c2_I20220517" decimals="5" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="-2" id="_943a1249-f6aa-4a65-a5b7-214a0b261df0">2.67</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">%</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i4db12266b7b2406a8f615282c97979f9_I20220930" decimals="5" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="-2" id="_d7e6ad61-7a79-4c89-8d17-d43f0dfb7227">4.24</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">%</span></td></tr></table></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The fair value of the embedded derivative liability identified in the 2021 Convertible Notes (Note 6) was a Level 3 fair value measurement. As of February&#160;12, 2021, the embedded derivative was remeasured based upon the conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ia124fe95dea5428b8bd88b641afc4ec4_I20210212" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM180MjI2_ecc9cfda-518b-483a-9fe2-03399609ae27">8.00</ix:nonFraction> per share upon closing of the IPO. As such, an expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie745d7ceafc041fb946aa34b70a7215a_D20210101-20210930" decimals="-3" sign="-" name="us-gaap:EmbeddedDerivativeGainLossOnEmbeddedDerivativeNet" scale="3" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM180Mjg3_53be0a60-c46f-4b97-aea7-02e875625745">89</ix:nonFraction> was recorded during the nine months ended September&#160;30, 2021.</span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i1fa0de33ec5d4864a080dffc5b0f0b2f_D20220101-20220930" name="us-gaap:InvestmentsClassifiedByContractualMaturityDateTableTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmU0NmI2OGFiNWVjNjQzNzliNTEwZjA2NWNiMjcyY2Y1L3NlYzplNDZiNjhhYjVlYzY0Mzc5YjUxMGYwNjVjYjI3MmNmNV8xMzgxL2ZyYWc6M2NmMGQ5NWU4ZTIyNGI4OGFhNzJlNGRiYTM0ZWJlMDMvdGV4dHJlZ2lvbjozY2YwZDk1ZThlMjI0Yjg4YWE3MmU0ZGJhMzRlYmUwM183MTQ2ODI1NTg1MTQz_ff2aef85-6750-45a9-943e-4df61cef034c" escape="true"><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following table summarizes the estimated fair value of our investments in marketable debt securities with stated contractual maturity dates, accounted for as available-for-sale securities and classified by the contractual maturity date of the securities:</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt"><table style="border